    {
      "id": "p0050-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In October 2015, several weeks after Undertale's English release, a Japanese gamer began to upload a series of Undertale gameplay videos to NicoNico Douga, a popular Japanese video site. These videos, which were painstakingly edited to include Japanese translations of all the English text, quickly gained impressive view counts.",
        "raw": "In October 2015, several weeks\nafter Underta/e's English release, a\nJapanese gamer began to upload\na series of Underta/e gameplay\nvideos to NicoNico Douga, a popular\nJapanese video site. These videos,\nwhich were painstakingly edited\nto include Japanese translations of\nall the English text, quickly gained\nimpressive view counts.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
