    {
      "id": "p0050-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because these early Undertale translations were presented as online videos, viewers could use the comment sections to react to the game as a community and to point out translation problems. Although these early video translations helped foster awareness and appreciation for Undertale in Japan, the game remained a small, niche secret until early 2016.",
        "raw": "Because these early Undertale translations were presented as online videos,\nviewers could use the comment sections to react to the game as a community\nand to point out translation problems. Although these early video translations\nhelped foster awareness and appreciation for Undertale in Japan, the game\nremained a small, niche secret until early 2016.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28814497,
          0.4382,
          0.88479567,
          0.52498571
