    {
      "id": "p0050-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In March 2016, fans released an unofficial translation \"patch\" that could replace all of the original English text in the game with translated Japanese text. At last, Japanese gamers could play Undertale for themselves in their native language. The fan community quickly exploded in size, and videos of the fan translation spread awareness of the game even further.",
        "raw": "In March 2016, fans released an\nunofficial translation \"patch\" that\ncould replace all of the original English\ntext in the game with translated\nJapanese text. At last, Japanese gamers\ncould play Undertale for themselves\nin their native language. The fan\ncommunity quickly exploded in size,\nand videos of the fan translation spread\nawareness of the game even further.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.60550718,
          0.56749286,
          0.89773039,
          0.74477143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.60418835,
